@base = http://localhost:8001

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List products
GET {{base}}/products

### Get one
GET {{base}}/products/1

### Create
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Desk Lamp", "price": 899, "stock": 40}

### Replace
PUT {{base}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Wireless Mouse", "price": 849, "stock": 45}

### Patch
PATCH {{base}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock": 44}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/products/6
